{"id":74,"title":"解答: 寻找第K大元素","summary":"本课给出 \"寻找第K大元素 \"问题的参考答案。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"26cd1ad0fb2411eb969e3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 答案","text_html":"<h2>答案</h2>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"26cd1d8cfb2411eb969e3af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"test_list = [40, 35, 82, 14, 22, 66, 53]\nk = 2\n\ntest_list.sort()\nkth_max = test_list[-k]\nprint(kth_max)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"26cd1e18fb2411eb969e3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 解释\n\n这个解决方案的核心是`sort()`方法。一旦列表被排序，我们所要做的就是确定正确的索引。这可以通过`[-k]`来完成，这相当于`[len(test_list)-k]`。\n\n想想为什么是`[-k]`?","text_html":"<h2>解释</h2>\n<p>这个解决方案的核心是<code>sort()</code>方法。一旦列表被排序，我们所要做的就是确定正确的索引。这可以通过<code>[-k]</code>来完成，这相当于<code>[len(test_list)-k]</code>。</p>\n<p>想想为什么是<code>[-k]</code>?</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2}],"status":"undo","course_no":"002","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/002/page/74"}
